      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This is a beginner-friendly stitch: two stitches, two heights, the same action across every row. It works in any weight. Aran acrylic is an easy starting point for a first textured throw. Total yardage is around 650 g."
          }
        ]
